      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a proposal for a new high-density residential complex in a mid-sized city. I need to prepare for a town hall meeting with the local community. Can you give me a summary of the main arguments people usually make against high-density zoning? I want to know what I'm up against.",
