      "content": "Thanks. Some of these feel a bit like the typical \"NIMBY\" complaints though, like the stuff about \"neighborhood character\" or \"community cohesion.\" In a professional urban planning report, how would you distinguish between legitimate, data-driven concerns and just people being resistant to change?",
